{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is a multi-ending horror game set in Japan.<br>The story branches based on the player's choices, leading to different endings.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is inspired by the <strong>Satori</strong>, a mythical creature from Japanese folklore with the ability to read people's minds.<br>Its power serves as a key element that creates fear and mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the player explores eerie shrines and dimly lit mansions,<br>they must uncover the hidden secrets within.<br>Will you be able to reach the truth of this strange world?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game focuses on puzzle-solving elements and branching storylines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A single choice may have a significant impact on your fate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Streaming &amp; Let\u2019s Play Videos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We <strong>welcome</strong> gameplay videos and live streams.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Request</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The developer of this game is a <strong>first-time creator</strong> and a <strong>high school student</strong> with no professional experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There may be some rough edges, but we would greatly appreciate your understanding.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3519830?t=1741297437","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519830/52431cfc74f995355277506ce191e85173f1ff5b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741297437","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519830/6306b5e17eeb820a8b88c2ed2aee7c3fe7d72eae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741297437","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519830/6306b5e17eeb820a8b88c2ed2aee7c3fe7d72eae/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741297437","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game features scenes where characters are struck or experience bone fractures as part of the game over animations."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is a multi-ending horror game set in Japan.<br>The story branches based on the player's choices, leading to different endings.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is inspired by the <strong>Satori</strong>, a mythical creature from Japanese folklore with the ability to read people's minds.<br>Its power serves as a key element that creates fear and mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the player explores eerie shrines and dimly lit mansions,<br>they must uncover the hidden secrets within.<br>Will you be able to reach the truth of this strange world?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game focuses on puzzle-solving elements and branching storylines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A single choice may have a significant impact on your fate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Streaming &amp; Let\u2019s Play Videos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We <strong>welcome</strong> gameplay videos and live streams.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Request</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The developer of this game is a <strong>first-time creator</strong> and a <strong>high school student</strong> with no professional experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There may be some rough edges, but we would greatly appreciate your understanding.</p>","developers":["Burg Game Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519830/dae774aaa1c660e051c0dad229df0714190d8ffb/hea